124..199 Comment "/// The binary corolla\'s code holds `plus`, `plus` with its inputs swapped,"
200..279 Comment "/// `times` and `times` swapped. `cross` exchanges `plus` and `times` and fixes"
280..360 Comment "/// both swapped forms: it is its own inverse, so code univalence accepts it and"
361..431 Comment "/// the hand-built product is a path, but it does not commute with the"
432..477 Comment "/// corolla\'s input swap, so `ua` refuses it."
